<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-NRG invests in Energy Develop..</title>
<headline>RTRS-NRG invests in Energy Develop..</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent electricity generator Energy Developments Ltd said on Thursday it had formed a strategic alliance with U.S.-based independent power producer, NRG Energy Inc which would inject A$32 million into Energy Developments via a placement.</p>
</text>
